WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.086 --> 00:00:05.806
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:05.807 --> 00:00:07.977
What do they see?

3
00:00:07.978 --> 00:00:11.322
They see a laundry.

4
00:00:11.323 --> 00:00:17.616
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:27.052
There are lots of dirty clothes.

6
00:00:27.053 --> 00:00:51.005
There are lots of carts.

7
00:00:51.006 --> 00:01:26.074
There are lots of detergent bottles.

8
00:01:26.075 --> 00:01:38.287
There are lots of hangers.

9
00:01:38.288 --> 00:01:53.089
There are lots of washing machines.

10
00:01:53.090 --> 00:02:05.107
There are lots of dryers.

11
00:02:05.108 --> 00:02:09.871
Blobs, what do you have?

12
00:02:09.872 --> 00:02:14.711
Those aren't your clean sheets!

13
00:02:14.712 --> 00:02:18.039
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:21.248
Good-bye!

